{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["A stretch of — like ירוע כבירים and ואוריד כביר יושבים: a term of multitude. According to the distance of the land up to Efrat, she was buried on the road." "And her labor was hard — like וַתְּקָשֶּׁה. Like ותצו / ותצוה; ותכס / ותכסה. [That is, the form without the final heh is equivalent to the form with it.]"], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {0 "Rashbam cites Isaiah 10:13 (כבירים) and Numbers 24:19 (כביר); the sense is that כברת denotes a large measure of ground, and the verse notes that the burial took place on the road, given the full distance to Efrat."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:46:17.032125703Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}